<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَقْهَاقٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَهْقَاهٌ</span>; and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَقْحِقٌ</span></b> . (TA.) [See
